<li>Neon works with AI IDEs and coding agents with tools like <a class="" href="https://neon.com/docs/ai/neon-mcp-server">MCP</a>, <a class="" href="https://neon.com/docs/reference/cli-init">neon init</a>, and Neon <a class="" href="https://neon.com/docs/ai/ai-rules">skills</a></li>
</ul>
